sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Finger
  participant G as Grabber
  participant W as World
  participant B as Body
  participant S as Jelly shader
  participant P as Dice page
  U->>G: pointerdown on canvas
  G->>B: raycast hit, wake, uGrabW set to 1
  U->>G: pointerup within 220 ms and no move
  G->>B: tap impulse 3.2 plus torque
  G->>P: release event, rolling true
  loop every frame, 240 Hz sub steps
    W->>B: gravity, integrate, corner spheres vs floor
    B-->>W: impulse per unit mass above 0.35
    W->>B: wobble into weakest slot
    W->>P: onImpact strength to clack synth
  end
  W->>B: settleStep slerps nearest face flat
  B->>S: uN uT uA uGrabD per frame
  S-->>P: wobbling mesh and shadow rendered
  P->>P: upValue per die, tally and aria-live
